---
import Shell from '../../../layouts/Shell.astro';
import articles from '../../../data/dongariya.json';
const indexImage={src:'/assets/dongariya/00-index-clothing-1200w.webp',alt:'Illustration of two women wearing embroidered Dongria wraps against green hills.',width:1200,height:800};
---
<Shell title="Dongria Kondh: cloth, language and life in Niyamgiri" description="Twelve connected articles on Kapadaganda, Kuvi, cultivation, learning and life in Niyamgiri, with sources and credited images." active="explore" related={false} shareImage={indexImage}>
<section class="series"><p class="eyebrow">People · Place · Living knowledge</p><h1>Dongria Kondh:<br/>life in Niyamgiri</h1><p class="intro">An embroidered cloth opens a wider story: of cultivation and exchange, language and learning, and the people whose lives connect them.</p>
<figure class="series-hero">
 <img src={indexImage.src} srcset="/assets/dongariya/00-index-clothing-480w.webp 480w, /assets/dongariya/00-index-clothing-800w.webp 800w, /assets/dongariya/00-index-clothing-1200w.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 832px) calc(100vw - 2.8rem), 788px" alt={indexImage.alt} width={indexImage.width} height={indexImage.height} fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"/>
 <figcaption>Dongria dress and embroidered wraps — an interpretive illustration. The figures and hillside setting are imagined.</figcaption>
 <p class="series-image-credit">Adapted illustration: Project Odisha, <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/">CC BY-SA 4.0</a>. Adapted from a clothing reference: <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:The_Dongria_Khond_is_an_ancient_tribe_of_Odisha._The_Dongria_Khonds_women_performing_a_traditional_Khonda_dance.jpg">photograph by Debanutosh</a>, <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/">CC BY-SA 4.0</a>.</p>
</figure>
<p>Explore twelve connected articles. Each includes source notes; photographs and conceptual illustrations are identified in their captions.</p>
<ol>{articles.map((article,index)=><li><span class="number">{String(index+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><a href={`/stories/dongariya/${article.slug}/`}>{article.title}<span aria-hidden="true"> ↗</span></a></li>)}</ol>
<p>By Ahimanikya Satapathy.</p></section>
</Shell>
<style>
.series{max-width:52rem;margin:3rem auto 5rem;padding:0 1.4rem;line-height:1.8}.series h1{font-size:clamp(2.3rem,1.4rem + 4vw,4rem);line-height:1.1;margin:1rem 0 2rem}.series p{margin-bottom:1.5rem}.intro{font-size:1.3rem}.series ol{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:3rem 0}.series li{display:flex;gap:1.25rem;align-items:baseline;border-top:1px solid #d5c9b7;padding:1.2rem 0}.number{color:#91462f;min-width:1.5rem}.series a{font-size:1.2rem;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:4px}
.series-hero{margin:2rem 0}.series-hero img{display:block;width:100%;max-width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:3/2}.series-hero figcaption{margin-top:.85rem;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.65}.series .series-image-credit{margin-top:.5rem;font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.65}.series-image-credit a{font-size:inherit}
</style>
